__pyx_doc_18charset_normalizer_2cd_14alpha_unicode_split␀___pyx_doc_18charset_normalizer_2cd_16merge_coherence_ratios␀___pyx_doc_18charset_normalizer_2cd_18filter_alt_coherence_matches␀___pyx_doc_18charset_normalizer_2cd_20coherence_ratio␀__dyld_private␀___pyx_moduledef␀___pyx_moduledef_slots␀___Pyx_check_single_interpreter.main_interpreter_id␀___pyx_CommonTypesMetaclass_slots␀___pyx_CommonTypesMetaclass_getset␀___pyx_CyFunctionType_spec␀___pyx_CyFunctionType_slots␀___pyx_CyFunction_methods␀___pyx_CyFunction_members␀___pyx_CyFunction_getsets␀___Pyx_UnboundCMethod_Def␀__MergedGlobals␀___pyx_methods␀___pyx_v_18charset_normalizer_2cd__LANGUAGE_RANKS␀__MergedGlobals.279␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀˙ﬁ¿␀␀F␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀$␀␀␀␀␀2␀␀␀␀␀>˙ﬁ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Æ␀␀␀X␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ä¿ ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¿␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀cd.cpython-312-darwin␀òy êN´euxåJ†∞RNjÄø«£-¯“7¶C˘Ü␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ë@º"¥‚óRø
