    Split all the strings in ss at any of the characters in chars.
    Example:

        >>> ss = ["a.string[0].with_separators"]
        >>> chars = list(".[]_")
        >>> split_multichar(ss, chars)
        ['a', 'string', '0', '', 'with', 'separators']

